      "text": "Entity :- Entity is a Table which we create in Database via program using @Entity annotation. \nWhy because  via program this class can be inherited from other class, we can implement interface ..etc.\n\n1) User\n2) Short-url\n3) Long-url ",
      "fontSize": 25.78842647067576,
