    {
      "id": "kz4kxc-A1A27O23HHk4-n",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 13.267581741658205,
      "y": 1483.9900732553333,
      "width": 2208.22140204711,
      "height": 390.6238131710478,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b03",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 593274821,
      "version": 1097,
      "versionNonce": 1805679787,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779287943695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Here first take any long URL like  https://www.linkedin.com/in/hareesh-mittapalli-30005852/  ---> shortURL something like  ==> bit.ly/g236h43 ==> Leave it bit.ly mainly code { g236h43 } \n\nFirst thing in the mind we think is encryption of URL's  for that we have.... md5 (32 length), sha1 (40 length)& base64  encryptions. \n\n \nLets say for this above linkedIn URL in if we paste in ( https://www.md5hashgenerator.com/)  it provides  md5 encrypted with 32 chracters length && Sha1 has 40 chracters length\n\nbut we just need 6 or 7 chracters.   If we take initial 6 characters then there will be other problem like most the users may have same initial 6 chracters it might not unique. \n\n \n\n ",
      "fontSize": 26.041587544736547,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Here first take any long URL like  https://www.linkedin.com/in/hareesh-mittapalli-30005852/  ---> shortURL something like  ==> bit.ly/g236h43 ==> Leave it bit.ly mainly code { g236h43 } \n\nFirst thing in the mind we think is encryption of URL's  for that we have.... md5 (32 length), sha1 (40 length)& base64  encryptions. \n\n \nLets say for this above linkedIn URL in if we paste in ( https://www.md5hashgenerator.com/)  it provides  md5 encrypted with 32 chracters length && Sha1 has 40 chracters length\n\nbut we just need 6 or 7 chracters.   If we take initial 6 characters then there will be other problem like most the users may have same initial 6 chracters it might not unique. \n\n \n\n ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
