    },
    {
      "id": "N72ZxdVwcNzEN4jcCqUbN",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 60.750040980222025,
      "y": 3584.92999961985,
      "width": 2174.1982421875,
      "height": 210,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0H",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 590183883,
      "version": 558,
      "versionNonce": 926358923,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779287943695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "So,  lets say 2nd long URL,  First we encrpt url (1ms) --> and check in DB (10ms) lets say it's exists  then we comeback again encrypt (1ms) ---> again scan this in db(10ms)\nif its not exists then save it in db (5ms)\n\nSo if we see  1ms+ 10 ms+  1ms + 10ms+ 5ms ===> Overall its 27ms \n\nWe don't know 1Billion URL's this time frame may increse  ...so latency may increse.  ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "So,  lets say 2nd long URL,  First we encrpt url (1ms) --> and check in DB (10ms) lets say it's exists  then we comeback again encrypt (1ms) ---> again scan this in db(10ms)\nif its not exists then save it in db (5ms)\n\nSo if we see  1ms+ 10 ms+  1ms + 10ms+ 5ms ===> Overall its 27ms \n\nWe don't know 1Billion URL's this time frame may increse  ...so latency may increse.  ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "HPlesqb_XUmsS5EVfhnUK",
      "type": "text",
