      "updated": 1779287943695,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Before that if we see need to support 1B users among that , how many users perform shorterening of there longUrl  \n\nLet's say 30% users converting to ShortUrl from LongUrl\nRest 70% performing redirection to longUrl from shortURL.\n\nHere for both operations above if you see we are using common server. It may increase load on that. \nBefore implementing Zookeeper lets split servers.",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Before that if we see need to support 1B users among that , how many users perform shorterening of there longUrl  \n\nLet's say 30% users converting to ShortUrl from LongUrl\nRest 70% performing redirection to longUrl from shortURL.\n\nHere for both operations above if you see we are using common server. It may increase load on that. \nBefore implementing Zookeeper lets split servers.",
