    {
      "id": "uUnZ0UAssOQM25sM0t67O",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 176.3186944153539,
      "y": 11513.509020390871,
      "width": 1701.935302734375,
      "height": 1035,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#6741d9",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffffff",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b3Z",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 711149131,
      "version": 298,
      "versionNonce": 398916907,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1779289743708,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Imagine a server generates a Snowflake ID with the following component values:\n\nTimestamp: 1,715,645,432,000 (41 bits)\n\nMachine ID: 512 (10 bits)\n\nCounter : 7 (12 bits)In the server's memory, \n\nthese components are converted into binary and lined up side-by-side into a \nsingle 64-bit string:0000001100110010011011011100111111011000001000000000000000000111\n\n\nThen convert to integer Like \n     TimeStampValue * 2^22 + machineID * 2^12 + counter * 2^0 \n\nTotal value is 7,196,009,474,998,272,159, is exactly 19 digits long passed into Base62 converter. \n\n\nThe standard Base62 character index mapping used is : \n\n0–9 --->  Positions 0–9 \na–z  ---> Positions 10–35\nA–Z ----> Positions 36–61",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Imagine a server generates a Snowflake ID with the following component values:\n\nTimestamp: 1,715,645,432,000 (41 bits)\n\nMachine ID: 512 (10 bits)\n\nCounter : 7 (12 bits)In the server's memory, \n\nthese components are converted into binary and lined up side-by-side into a \nsingle 64-bit string:0000001100110010011011011100111111011000001000000000000000000111\n\n\nThen convert to integer Like \n     TimeStampValue * 2^22 + machineID * 2^12 + counter * 2^0 \n\nTotal value is 7,196,009,474,998,272,159, is exactly 19 digits long passed into Base62 converter. \n\n\nThe standard Base62 character index mapping used is : \n\n0–9 --->  Positions 0–9 \na–z  ---> Positions 10–35\nA–Z ----> Positions 36–61",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
